   \hline
   1 & 14 \\
   2 & 5 \\
   3 & 9 \\
   4 & 7 \\
   5 & 7 \\
   6 & 8 \\
   \hline
   \end{array}
   \]

2. **Calculate the Total Sum of Outcomes**:
   We compute the total sum by multiplying each outcome by its respective count:

   \[
   \text{Total Sum} = (1 \times 14) + (2 \times 5) + (3 \times 9) + (4 \times 7) + (5 \times 7) + (6 \times 8)
   \]

   Calculating each term:

   - \(1 \times 14 = 14\)
   - \(2 \times 5 = 10\)
   - \(3 \times 9 = 27\)
   - \(4 \times 7 = 28\)
