Using the principle of inclusion-exclusion, the total number of favorable outcomes can be calculated as follows:

\[
\text{Total Favorable Outcomes} = (\text{Number of Odd Cards}) + (\text{Number of Spades}) - (\text{Number of Odd Spades})
\]

### Step-by-Step Calculations

