   \]

3. **Calculate the length of the hallway**:
   Given that it takes 90 seconds to travel the hallway:
   \[
   L = v \times 90 \text{ seconds} = \left(\frac{1}{9} \text{ m/s}\right) \times 90 \text{ s} = 10 \text{ meters}
   \]

### Code Interpretation
