   \text{Area} = \frac{1}{2} \times (y + 5) \times \frac{x}{\sqrt{2}}.
   \]

5. Equating the two expressions for the area:
   \[
   \frac{x^2}{2} = \frac{1}{2} \times (y + 5) \times \frac{x}{\sqrt{2}}.
   \]
