   - If \( \gcd(m, n) = 1 \), compute:
   \[
   a = 6m, \quad b = 6n
   \]
   \[
   \text{lcm}(a, b) = \frac{a \cdot b}{6} = \frac{(6m)(6n)}{6} = 6mn
   \]

