### Step 1: State the Problem Clearly
We need to determine the last time before noon that two cameras, A and B, take pictures simultaneously. Camera A starts at 6 AM and takes pictures every 11 minutes, while Camera B starts at 7 AM and takes pictures every 7 minutes. We need to find the last time they take pictures together before noon.

