Finally, compute:
\[
(a + b)^{-1}(a^{-1} + b^{-1}) \equiv 1 \cdot 4 \equiv 4 \pmod{7}
\]

### Final Answer
The remainder when \( (a + b)^{-1}(a^{-1} + b^{-1}) \) is divided by \( n \) is:
\[
\boxed{4}
\]
