2025-07-13 08:54:52 - INFO - ```python
def solve():
    # List of integers provided in the problem
    integers = [85, 49479, -67, 12000003, -3]
    
    # Filter out integers that are congruent to 3 (mod 7)
    filtered_integers = [num for num in integers if num % 7 != 3]
    
    # Sum the remaining integers
    result = sum(filtered_integers)
    
    return result

