\]

### Final Answer
The vector \(\mathbf{c}\) is:
\[
\boxed{\begin{pmatrix} \frac{\sqrt{29}}{\sqrt{10}} \\ \frac{3\sqrt{29}}{\sqrt{10}} \end{pmatrix}}
\]
