   \]
   Thus,
   \[
   6^7 \mod 13 = 7
   \]

4. **Calculate \(8^9 \mod 13\)**:
   We compute \(8^9 \mod 13\):
   \[
   8^1 \equiv 8 \mod 13
   \]
   \[
   8^2 = 64 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 64 \mod 13 = 12
   \]
