5 \div 4 = 1 \quad \text{remainder } 1 \\
1 \div 4 = 0 \quad \text{remainder } 1
\]
Thus, \( 22_{10} = 112_4 \).

### Conclusion
The base 3 representation \( 211_3 \) is indeed the reverse of the base 4 representation \( 112_4 \).

The final answer is:
\[
\boxed{22}
\]
