\]

### Step-by-Step Calculations
To minimize \(E\), we can apply the Cauchy-Schwarz inequality:

\[
\left( \frac{a_1}{b_1} + \frac{a_2}{b_2} \right) \left( b_1 + b_2 \right) \geq (a_1 + a_2)^2
\]

