   To perform this subtraction, we convert \( 1 \) into a fraction with a denominator of \( 1024 \):
   \[
   1 = \frac{1024}{1024}
   \]
   Thus,
   \[
   P(\text{solving in 5 tries}) = \frac{1024}{1024} - \frac{243}{1024} = \frac{1024 - 243}{1024} = \frac{781}{1024}
   \]

